      "post_id": "67856",
      "author_handle": "glowingsun",
      "date_as_displayed": "Posted 18 years 1 week ago",
      "body": "When I was breast feeding Candra, I had some painful problems along the way resulting me in favoring 1 breast for a few weeks. My mom got quite angry with me because she told me that 1 breast will be bigger than the other. O.k, I know that 1 breast will differ insize from the other. I told my mom this and she said that their supposed to be the same size or not be different in size by that much.\nMy right breast is noticably different by at least 1 cup and it's difficult to find a proper fitting bra.\nDo any of you have this problem?",
      "permalink": "https://www.justparents.co.uk/forums/topic-6946/#67856",
      "raw_file": "_raw/forums-deep/justparents/responses/c9b8d9acf14927b8bb1a.html",
      "page_url": "https://www.justparents.co.uk/forums/topic-6946/",
