      "post_id": "67895",
      "author_handle": "GTTkel",
      "date_as_displayed": "Posted 18 years 1 week ago",
      "body": "I have to say that if I look at myself in the mirror from my left side and then from my right side my left boob looks fuller, my right one is a little deflated looking in comparison. Thankfully they both look ok as I look down on them 😉",
