    {
      "post_id": "74635",
      "author_handle": "Bounty2009",
      "date_as_displayed": "Posted 17 years 10 months ago",
      "body": "Are you still breast feeding? If you are experiencing pain in one breast I would recommend seeing a doctor to make sure everything is ok. Regarding the size however, it is quite normal to have slightly different breasts - hopefully the only problem is cosmetic and you could try filling the bra with the smaller breast in with breast enhancers (Chicken fillets!) to deal with that.",
      "permalink": "https://www.justparents.co.uk/forums/topic-6946/#74635",
